graph TB
    subgraph Image["llama-stack-provider-trustyai-garak image<br/>quay.io/rhoai/odh-trustyai-garak-lls-provider-dsp-rhel9"]
        subgraph JobPod["eval-hub Job pod (adapter entrypoint)"]
            Adapter["evalhub.garak_adapter.GarakAdapter<br/>FrameworkAdapter"]
            KFPAdapter["evalhub.kfp_adapter.GarakKFPAdapter<br/>forces execution_mode=kfp"]
            ConfigRes["core.config_resolution /<br/>core.command_builder"]
            Runner["core.garak_runner<br/>subprocess, shell=False, timeout"]
            Garak["garak CLI<br/>==0.17.0+rhaiv.4"]
            Results["result_utils.py + resources/<br/>JSONL/AVID parse, TBSA, HTML"]
            KFPAdapter -->|subclass of| Adapter
            Adapter -->|resolve profile + overrides| ConfigRes
            Adapter -->|simple mode| Runner
            Runner -->|garak --config| Garak
            Adapter -->|parse reports| Results
        end
        subgraph Pipeline["evalhub.kfp_pipeline: evalhub-garak-scan (same image)"]
            S1[validate] --> S2[resolve_taxonomy] --> S3[sdg_generate] --> S4[prepare_prompts] --> S5[garak_scan] --> S6[write_kfp_outputs]
        end
        Steps["core.pipeline_steps<br/>API key resolution, redaction"]
        SDG["sdg.py / intents.py<br/>sdg-hub via LiteLLM"]
        S3 -.->|uses| SDG
        Pipeline -.->|uses| Steps
    end

    EvalHub["eval-hub<br/>Job launcher + sidecar"] -->|launches Job, JobSpec /meta/job.json| Adapter
    Adapter -->|report_status / report_results<br/>localhost:8080| EvalHub
    Adapter -->|KFP mode: submit + poll| DSP["Data Science Pipelines<br/>KFP API"]
    DSP -->|runs| Pipeline
    Adapter -->|read image ConfigMap,<br/>Data Connection Secret| K8sAPI["Kubernetes API"]
    OperatorCM["trustyai-service-operator-config<br/>garak-provider-image"] -.->|image for KFP components| Pipeline
    Garak -->|adversarial prompts| Models["Model endpoints<br/>target / attacker / judge / evaluator<br/>OpenAI-compatible"]
    S5 -->|adversarial prompts| Models
    SDG -->|SDG requests| Models
    Pipeline -->|artifacts| S3Store["S3 storage<br/>Data Connection"]
    Adapter -->|download results| S3Store
    Adapter -.->|optional via SDK| OCI["OCI registry / MLflow"]

